o ran on a promise to stand up to Trump and make Canada more independent fr=
om the United States. So they were already primed to see these trade talks =
as about more than just aluminum and softwood lumber. They see them as abou=
t sovereignty.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;co=
lor:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>The sense that Carney did the right thing i=
